/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 760 Tm (1. Truth) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 732 Tm (Truth begins with seeing what is actually present. Separate an observation from an assumption and notice where a story has been added. Truth is not harshness; it is the willingness to meet facts, feelings and choices honestly before deciding what to do next.) Tj
ET
endstream
