BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 760 Tm (2. Tact) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 732 Tm (Tact is thoughtful judgement in relationship with other people. It includes sympathy, understanding and the ability to consider the likely consequences of an action before taking it. Tact is not weakness or people-pleasing. It lets you speak clearly while remembering that another person has a perspective, context and dignity of their own.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
