/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 760 Tm (3. Loyalty) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 732 Tm (Loyalty is steadiness toward a chosen value, promise or relationship. It is tested by ordinary repetition: keeping an agreement, returning to a practice and acting consistently when enthusiasm changes. Loyalty should include discernment; it does not require remaining in a harmful situation or abandoning your boundaries.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
