/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 760 Tm (4. Individuality) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 732 Tm (Individuality means developing your own understanding and responsibility. Study can offer a map, but it cannot make your decisions for you. Notice which interpretations help you think and act more deliberately, then make room for your own experience rather than copying someone else’s identity or method.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
