/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 760 Tm (5. Courage) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 732 Tm (Courage is the capacity to take a considered step while uncertainty is still present. It may mean asking an honest question, changing a familiar response or beginning an exercise without knowing exactly what you will discover. A brave action can be small, informed and reversible.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
