BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 760 Tm (8. Sagacity) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 732 Tm (Sagacity is practical wisdom: the ability to weigh context, timing and consequences before choosing. It grows through experience, honest review and a willingness to revise an idea when new information appears. Sagacity keeps principles grounded, so insight can become a measured and responsible next action.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
